  "articleBody": "Before requesting laundry room remodeling proposals, document the room’s measurements, appliance dimensions, utility locations, storage goals, finish preferences, and any problems such as leaks, poor drainage, heat, noise, or limited access. Ask each provider to explain the proposed layout, permit responsibilities, design selections, construction sequence, allowances, and items excluded from the estimate so competing proposals can be compared accurately.",
